<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>ConsentText</key>
	<dict>
		<key>default</key>
		<string>Cloudflare 1.1.1.1 for Families, security only. Blocks malware and phishing domains.

This profile only changes the DNS resolver used by this device to an encrypted one (DNS over HTTPS / DNS over TLS). It does not install certificates, VPNs, or any management. You can remove it at any time from Settings.</string>
		<key>en</key>
		<string>Cloudflare 1.1.1.1 for Families, security only. Blocks malware and phishing domains.

This profile only changes the DNS resolver used by this device to an encrypted one (DNS over HTTPS / DNS over TLS). It does not install certificates, VPNs, or any management. You can remove it at any time from Settings.</string>
		<key>zh-Hant</key>
		<string>Cloudflare 1.1.1.2，只擋惡意程式與釣魚網域，其餘不過濾。

此描述檔只會把裝置使用的 DNS 解析器改成加密連線（DNS over HTTPS / DNS over TLS），不會安裝憑證、VPN 或任何管理設定，隨時可在「設定」中移除。</string>
	</dict>
